  - macroeconomic forecasting
  - Diebold-Mariano test
  - expanding window evaluation
  - European economies
  - spatio-temporal forecasting
abstract: >
  This study forecasts quarterly CPI inflation (year-over-year) for 20 European
  economies using Graph Neural Networks built on dynamic quarterly trade networks.
  A prospective expanding-window benchmark (2017Q1–2025Q3) evaluates 12 models
  across 8 graph adjacency specifications and 3 forecast horizons using
  38,380 model fits and 781,740 forecast rows.
